          "text": "Serena Williams and Carlos Alcaraz are out of the US Open mixed doubles. They won their R1 match over Routliffe/Glasspool 5-3, 4-1, then lost the quarterfinal to Cobolli and Bencic 5-4(4), 4-1. Fun while it lasted.\n\n#Tennis #USOpen2026 #Alcaraz #SerenaWilliams",
